Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenth Episode\NThe Dangerous Doll
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz, shame on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A noble of your rank\Nyawning like that..!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry! Last\Nnight I read until late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.78,0:02:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch how you behave\Nwhen we are ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a Prince and\Neveryone will be watching you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin,\Nwhere is the Prince, my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He went for a walk,\NSire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Sapphire\Nalways embarrasses me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, Franz is a fine Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome\Nto our lands, dear Charles V!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We are pleased to see you again\Nafter such a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And so Prince Franz\Nhas disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems so! He too had been\Ninvited as a guest to court!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,One does not disregard etiquette like this!\NHis father is very displeased about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I like him\Nand I'm going to look for him too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot! First you must greet\NCharles V! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry so much\Nabout etiquette!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them I've disappeared too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! You cannot do that!\NAh, the youth of today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, Opal?\NLet's go, little horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'm here!\NTake me with you, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire must have come\Nto this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows where he went...! I'll ask\Nsomeone if they've seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.86,0:05:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange, it seems empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I bump into?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is this?\NBy the look of it, it seems to be a doll
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:05:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is this the mechanical doll?\N- Yes, Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't easy to make it, but in the\Nend the result is... remarkable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.06,0:06:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think, I had to\Nbring from a far-off country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...a master puppeteer\Nto build it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough chatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you assure me this doll\Nwill serve to kill Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, Grand Duke!\NThis time we will not fail,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,if Sapphire watches the carnival\Nfrom the seat he reserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know it walks?\NIn its stomach there is a boiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.06,0:06:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...that boils the water.\NThe steam that is released...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...drives an engine that allows her\Nto move and to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ingenious, isn't it?\N- Yes, not bad, not bad
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.98,0:06:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering if this doll\Nalso talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.78,0:06:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- No. - It would be fantastic\Nif she could.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be the best invention\Nof all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!\NBut then she can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't her,\Nbecause she can't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's who it was!\N- They saw me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, little one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.90,0:06:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!\NDon't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could he have got to?\NHe can't have gone far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet he must be here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned kid!\NI won't let him escape from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll stop you!\N- Help! Help, he wants to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What beautiful fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.18,0:08:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What a blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Prince Sapphire!\N- Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you've escaped from the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, here in town they are celebrating\Ncarnival! Shall we go see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's better to stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, you're absolutely right!\N- You should go out every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In the city there are\Na lot of fun things!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time.\NAlmost everything I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...I need to prevent\NNylon and Duralumin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...from carrying out\Ntheir evil plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,When we are Kings, we won't\Nbe able to have fun anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just thought of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, it's for you!\NCome on, take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought it before I\Nleft. I think you'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.46,0:09:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mirror! It's for\Nlooking at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard\Nthat maybe you are a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It will come in handy,\Nif you really are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a fool,\NPrince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, dressed\Nin such funny clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We are a group of masked\Nrevelers and we are going around...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...celebrating Carnival.\NCome with us, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, come with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No, please!\NPlease! I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnificent! It's the\Nmost beautiful costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's number one!\N- The best of the costumes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel a bit uncomfortable\Ndressed up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.74,0:09:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we're off to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.18,0:10:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could that beautiful\Ngirl with the long hair be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She's enchanting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I must try to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, may I have this dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is galloping this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're soldiers!\NWhat do they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is pleased to invite\Nyou to the ball at the royal castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- His Majesty!\N- His Majesty is truly generous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could she have\Ngone? I can't find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, have you seen\Na young girl with long hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I haven't seen anyone like that.\N- And you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.86,0:13:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't seen her either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet I am sure that she too\Nis here, somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Nylon, what have you done\Nwith that boy you captured?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I locked him in the building\Nwhere the doll is,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so tomorrow he too will end up\Ntogether with Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two are plotting\Nto kill Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I must look for him immediately and\Nwarn him of the danger he is in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.78,0:13:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea where\Nour two offspring might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry, they must be\Nhaving fun somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oops!\N- Please, Prince! Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.66,0:13:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you will play something\Nmore cheerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, Prince!\NAt your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at Sapphire, up to\None of his usual tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,As cheeky as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Maestro, I told you to play\Nmore cheerful music.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,More than this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We are still not there!\NI would like it more elegant
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell can we play?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Who is calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here, Sapphire!\NCan you come? I have to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you have to tell me that is so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught Baron Nylon\Nand Grand Duke Duralumin...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,while they were talking about killing you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's no surprise!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is nothing new to me!\NIt is always the same story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They were also talking about that child\Ncalled Tink...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...and that, if I'm not\Nmistaken, is a friend of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They said they are keeping him\Nprisoner in a building outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will start looking for\Nhim from this house!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, are you here? Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can make out the\Nshapes of strange puppets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.22,0:15:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, answer! Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.90,0:15:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What a huge doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer! Are you in here, Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that in here\Nhe is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go look for him somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.74,0:16:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Baron, I can't wait for\Nthis doll to go into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, Grand Duke!\NI will show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that wire?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as the doll's head\Nis level with that wire,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,its mechanism will fire a shot\Nright at Sapphire's chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.58,0:16:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But do you think the Prince\Nwill stand still...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...until the doll\Nhas passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! Together with the\Ndoctor, I've worked out a little trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Sapphire, tell me: did you\Nmanage to find that friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:17:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet. I've looked for him all\Nday, but there is no sign of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You've reminded me\Nthat I must go back and look for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay seated, Your Highness!\NYou promised me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you would be a good\NPrince for the whole day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, I promised you.\NI'll stay in my seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?\NJudging by the construction,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.22,0:17:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be\Ninside the doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.02,0:17:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In the doll's mouth\NI have placed a bow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...ready to shoot his arrow that\Nwill strike Sapphire in the heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A single shot will be enough, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you are in danger! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, he can't hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, be careful! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She has stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire has been hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- It worked!\N- It killed my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.66,0:19:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, the arrow hit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't do anything to me, as\Nyou can see! Your mirror saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards!\NDestroy that damn puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, King!\N- Help me! Pull me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.02,0:19:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned giant puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.62,0:20:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! What do you want to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.18,0:20:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I must stop\Nthat crazy doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank heaven, you're alive!\N- Tink! What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I was captured\Nby Baron Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then the doll is his!\N- Yes, he wanted to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We must destroy it!\NJust break the boiler!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, it might explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.58,0:21:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, Sapphire! It's heading\Ntowards the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.86,0:22:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help you stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.06,0:22:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It is trying\Nto destroy the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.50,0:22:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to stay here!\NLet's go outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.26,0:22:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink!\N- Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Run as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.90,0:23:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Franz, without your gift\NI would have died! You saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.90,0:23:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I apologize to you: I won't\Ntreat you like a girl anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you!\N- During the carnival
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I met a girl\Nwho had long hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.30,0:23:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...and she was so pretty!\NI hope to see her again, one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She has remained in my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.86,0:23:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you happen to meet\Nthat girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.14,0:23:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,tell her that I will return for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.50,0:23:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,See you soon,\Ndear Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:24:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Franz! I really think\Nthat I will meet that girl.
